[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5F85\u3061\u5408\u308F\u305B\u306E\u5834\u6240\u306F\u3053\u3053\u3060\u3088\u306D\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This is the meeting spot, right?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3001\u300C\u5927\u5207\u306A\u8A71\u304C\u3042\u308B\u300D\u3063\u3066\n\u3000\u3044\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\u306A\u3093\u306E\u8A71\u3060\u308D\u3046\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Valeria said she had \u0027something important to discuss\u0027... I wonder what it could be...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, Big Sis Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u3002\u6765\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3002\n\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u5927\u5207\u306A\u8A71\u3092\u3057\u306A\u304F\u3061\u3083\u3044\u3051\u306A\u3044\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha. Thank you for coming. I have something important I need to tell you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3002\u805E\u304B\u305B\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Please, go ahead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306E\u306D\u2026\u2026\n\u79C1\u306F\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u306E\u59C9\u3058\u3083\u3044\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3082\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... I might not be able to be your big sister anymore..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u2026\u2026\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\n\u308F\u305F\u3057\u306E\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3092\u3059\u308B\u306E\u3001\n\u75B2\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...? Could it be that you\u0027re tired of being my big sister...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3046\u3093\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3002\n\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u306E\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306B\u306A\u308C\u3066\u3001\n\u3059\u3054\u304F\u5B09\u3057\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, that\u0027s not it. Being your big sister has made me so happy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then why?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\n\u5E74\u4E0A\u3089\u3057\u304F\u983C\u308A\u304C\u3044\u304C\u3042\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u59B9\u304B\u3089\u5C0A\u656C\u3055\u308C\u308B\u5B58\u5728\u3060\u3068\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u601D\u3046\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think an older sister should be someone dependable and mature, someone their younger sibling can look up to."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u79C1\u306F\u3044\u3064\u3082\u5931\u6557\u3057\u3066\u3001\n\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u306B\u8FF7\u60D1\u304B\u3051\u3066\u3070\u304B\u308A\u3002\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306E\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I keep messing up and causing you trouble. That\u0027s not what a big sister should be!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3059\u3054\u304F\u983C\u308A\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u5C0A\u656C\u3067\u304D\u308B\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s not true at all! You\u0027re such a reliable and admirable big sister, Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u306B\uFF1F\u3000\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3048\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? What makes you think that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u5B88\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u983C\u308A\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re always protecting me and I can depend on you"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u5B88\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u983C\u308A\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\u3053\u306E\u524D\u3060\u3063\u3066\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\u3044\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\n\u308F\u305F\u3057\u306F\u7121\u4E8B\u3067\u306F\u3044\u3089\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re always protecting me and I can depend on you. If you hadn\u0027t been there the other day, I wouldn\u0027t have been safe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6226\u95D8\u306F\u79C1\u306E\u53D6\u308A\u67C4\u3060\u3082\u306E\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u306B\u306F\u5C11\u3057\u81EA\u4FE1\u304C\u3042\u308B\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Combat is my strong point. I do have some confidence in that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u79C1\u306F\u5B89\u5FC3\u3057\u3066\u85AC\u8349\u3092\u96C6\u3081\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because you\u0027re there, I can gather herbs without worrying!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u3066\u3066\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re always trying your best and that\u0027s wonderful"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3001\n\u3044\u3064\u3082\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u3066\u3066\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria, you\u0027re always trying your best and that\u0027s wonderful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3001\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u3002\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E\u306F\u307F\u3093\u306A\u540C\u3058\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Ayesha. But isn\u0027t everyone trying their best?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u3060\u9811\u5F35\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\u30C0\u30E1\u3002\n\u983C\u308A\u306B\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\u7D50\u679C\u3092\u6B8B\u3055\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3001\n\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u306E\u59C9\u306B\u306F\u306A\u308C\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3088\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just trying isn\u0027t enough. I need to show results that people can rely on, or I can\u0027t be your big sister..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u771F\u5263\u306B\u8003\u3048\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u2026\u2026\n\u305D\u308C\u306F\u305D\u308C\u3067\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To think you\u0027ve been considering it so seriously... That actually makes me happy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3054\u98EF\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u308B\u59FF\u306B\u5143\u6C17\u3092\u3082\u3089\u3048\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Watching you eat gives me energy"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\u3054\u98EF\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u308B\u59FF\u306B\n\u5143\u6C17\u3092\u3082\u3089\u3048\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Watching you eat gives me energy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u3054\u98EF\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3001\n\u3044\u3056\u3063\u3066\u3068\u304D\u306B\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3092\u5B88\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3082\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I have to eat properly to be able to protect everyone when it counts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305F\u307E\u306B\u98DF\u3079\u3059\u304E\u3066\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3\u306B\n\u6CE8\u610F\u3055\u308C\u308B\u306E\u3088\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though sometimes Heidi scolds me for eating too much..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u98DF\u3079\u308B\u91CF\u3092\u6E1B\u3089\u3057\u305F\u307B\u3046\u304C\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\u3057\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe I should cut back on how much I eat?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\u3001\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306A\u3055\u3044\uFF01\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3064\u3082\u308A\u3067\u8A00\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, I\u0027m sorry! That\u0027s not what I meant at all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3068\u3066\u3082\u983C\u308A\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u8003\u3048\u8FBC\u307E\u306A\u3044\u3067\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re very reliable, Valeria! Please don\u0027t overthink it so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3002\u307E\u3060\u307E\u3060\u7406\u60F3\u306E\u59C9\u306B\u306F\u8DB3\u308A\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u3082\u3063\u3068\u8272\u3005\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u3068\u30C0\u30E1\u306A\u306E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No. I\u0027m still far from being the ideal big sister. I need to be able to do so much more!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u81EA\u5206\u3067\u306F\u6C17\u4ED8\u3044\u3066\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3001\n\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3068\u3066\u3082\u7D20\u6575\u306A\u4EBA\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You might not realize it yourself, but you\u0027re already such a wonderful person!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u304B\u3057\u3089\u2026\u2026\u305F\u3068\u3048\u3070\u3069\u3093\u306A\u3068\u3053\u308D\u304C\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think so...? Like in what way?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8272\u3005\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306B\u6311\u6226\u3059\u308B\u59FF\u52E2\u304C\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The way you\u0027re willing to try new things is admirable"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8272\u3005\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306B\u6311\u6226\u3059\u308B\u59FF\u52E2\u304C\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The way you\u0027re willing to try new things is admirable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u308A\u3042\u3048\u305A\u6311\u6226\u3057\u3066\u307F\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3001\n\u4F55\u304C\u3067\u304D\u308B\u304B\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, you won\u0027t know what you can do unless you try, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3067\u8FF7\u60D1\u304B\u3051\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3082\u591A\u3044\u306E\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u8003\u3048\u306A\u3057\u306B\u624B\u3092\u51FA\u3059\u306E\u3082\u8003\u3048\u3082\u306E\u3060\u308F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I often cause trouble that way. Maybe I should think more before jumping into things..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8AB0\u3060\u3063\u3066\u6700\u521D\u306F\u4E0A\u624B\u304F\u3067\u304D\u306A\u304F\u3066\u5F53\u7136\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nobody\u0027s good at things when they first start."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3068\u5C11\u3057\u6C17\u304C\u697D\u306B\u306A\u308B\u308F\u3002\n\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u306D\u3001\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hearing you say that makes me feel a bit better. Thank you, Ayesha."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304D\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3068\u3057\u305F\u614B\u5EA6\u304C\u5C0A\u656C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I admire how decisive you are"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3001\u304D\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3068\u3057\u305F\u614B\u5EA6\u304C\n\u5C0A\u656C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I admire how decisive you are."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u3060\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m just saying what\u0027s on my mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u8A00\u3048\u308B\u306E\u304C\u3059\u3054\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u308F\u305F\u3057\u306F\u3001\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3082\u8A00\u3048\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3067",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being able to do that is amazing. Sometimes I can\u0027t say what I\u0027m thinking."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3051\u3069\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3082\u8A00\u3048\u3070\u3044\u3044\u308F\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\n\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF1F\u3000\u9593\u9055\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3082\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u8A00\u3046\u3057\u3001\n\u8A00\u308F\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\u3082\u591A\u3044\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you shouldn\u0027t just say everything that comes to mind, right? I say a lot of wrong things, and often regret what I\u0027ve said."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3044\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even so, I think it\u0027s a good thing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ED6\u4EBA\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u672C\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u308C\u3066\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s wonderful how you genuinely care for others"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ED6\u4EBA\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u672C\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u308C\u3066\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s wonderful how you genuinely care for others."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306E\u5927\u3057\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u308F\u3002\n\u305F\u3060\u56F0\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u4EBA\u3092\u653E\u3063\u3066\u304A\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3060\u3051\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s nothing special. I just can\u0027t ignore people who are in trouble."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3063\u3066\u884C\u52D5\u3067\u304D\u308B\u306E\u304C\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u8AB0\u3067\u3082\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being able to think and act that way is wonderful! Not everyone can do that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3001\u305D\u3046\uFF1F\u3000\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u7167\u308C\u308B\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-Really? You\u0027re making me blush..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ED6\u306E\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3082\u304D\u3063\u3068\n\u540C\u3058\u3088\u3046\u306B\u601D\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306F\u305A\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m sure everyone else feels the same way!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u9577\u6240\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u306A\u304B\u306A\u304B\u81EA\u5206\u3058\u3083\u6C17\u4ED8\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s hard to notice your own good points."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u307E\u3060\u6C17\u4ED8\u3051\u3066\u306A\u3044\u3001\n\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306E\u3044\u3044\u3068\u3053\u308D\u304C\n\u3082\u3063\u3068\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u3042\u308B\u306F\u305A\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m sure there are many more wonderful things about you that I haven\u0027t even noticed yet!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u306F\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u307E\u3060\u7D0D\u5F97\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You might say that, Ayesha, but I still can\u0027t accept it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u306E\u79C1\u306B\u306F\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304C\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u3042\u308B\u3002\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u72B6\u614B\u3067\u59C9\u306B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u306A\u308C\u306A\u3044\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There are so many things I still can\u0027t do. How can I be a big sister like this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3059\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can learn to do those things from now on"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u3001\n\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3059\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then you can learn to do those things from now on."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308B\u307E\u3067\u305A\u3063\u3068\n\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306B\u8FF7\u60D1\u304B\u3051\u308B\u306E\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But until I learn, I\u0027ll keep causing trouble for everyone, won\u0027t I?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u3057\u306F\u6C17\u306B\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\n\u304D\u3063\u3068\u4ED6\u306E\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3082\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don\u0027t mind that. I\u0027m sure nobody else does either."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u30FC\u3093\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3082\u79C1\u306F\u6C17\u306B\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3046\u308F\u3002\n\u3069\u308C\u3060\u3051\u6642\u9593\u304C\u304B\u304B\u308B\u304B\u3082\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, I still worry about it. And who knows how long it will take..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I have things I can\u0027t do too"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u59C9\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m a big sister too, but there are things I can\u0027t do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3082\u79C1\u3088\u308A\u8272\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF1F\n\u79C1\u306F\u6226\u95D8\u4EE5\u5916\u304B\u3089\u3063\u304D\u3057\u3060\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you can do so many more things than me, right? I\u0027m only good at fighting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306B\u52A9\u3051\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3063\u3066\u3070\u304B\u308A\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s not true. I\u0027m always getting help from everyone too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5168\u90E8\u3092\u4E00\u4EBA\u3067\u3084\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u3093\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3067\u52A9\u3051\u5408\u3063\u3066\u3044\u304F\u306E\u304C\u3001\n\u53CB\u9054\u3084\u5BB6\u65CF\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You don\u0027t need to do everything alone. I think friends and family are about helping each other."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52A9\u3051\u5408\u3046\u3001\u304B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Helping each other, huh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u4EE3\u308F\u308A\u3059\u3054\u304F\u5F37\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you\u0027re really strong in exchange!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u4EE3\u308F\u308A\u3059\u3054\u304F\u5F37\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you\u0027re really strong in exchange!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306B\u306F\u305D\u308C\u3057\u304B\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s all I have."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5341\u5206\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01\n\u308F\u305F\u3057\u306B\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306A\u306E\u3067\u5C0A\u656C\u3057\u3066\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s plenty! I admire you because it\u0027s something I can\u0027t do!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F37\u3044\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\u30C0\u30E1\u306A\u306E\u3088\u3002\n\u5F37\u3055\u3060\u3051\u3067\u5BFE\u51E6\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306F\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u3042\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being strong isn\u0027t enough. There are lots of things that can\u0027t be solved with strength alone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u79C1\u304C\u59C9\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How can someone like me be a big sister..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3063\u304B\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Oh, I see now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3001\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u3002\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u304A\u304B\u3052\u3067\u6C17\u4ED8\u3044\u305F\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Ayesha. Thanks to you, I\u0027ve realized something."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3001\u59C9\u3063\u3066\u3059\u3054\u304F\u7279\u5225\u306A\u5B58\u5728\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3002\n\u3067\u3082\u672C\u5F53\u306F\u305D\u3046\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought being a big sister meant being someone special. But that wasn\u0027t true at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3002\u59C9\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3063\u3066\n\u3059\u3054\u3044\u4EBA\u3067\u3042\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u305C\u3093\u305C\u3093\u3059\u3054\u304F\u306A\u3093\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right. You don\u0027t need to be amazing just because you\u0027re a big sister. I\u0027m certainly not amazing either."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u524D\u3001\u98A8\u90AA\u85AC\u3092\u3042\u3052\u305F\u5B50\u3092\u899A\u3048\u3066\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\n\u3042\u306E\u5B50\u305F\u3061\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306B\u56F0\u3063\u305F\u3089\u52A9\u3051\u5408\u3046\u2026\u2026\n\u305D\u308C\u304C\u59C9\u59B9\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Remember those children we gave cold medicine to? I think being sisters means helping each other when we\u0027re in trouble, like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3002\u304A\u304B\u3052\u3067\u76EE\u304C\u899A\u3081\u305F\u308F\u3002\n\u79C1\u3001\u7121\u7406\u3057\u3066\u80CC\u4F38\u3073\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you. You\u0027ve opened my eyes. I was trying too hard to be something I\u0027m not."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u306F\u59B9\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026\n\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u304A\u6BCD\u3055\u3093\u3067\u3082\u3042\u308B\u308F\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha, you might be my little sister, but... you\u0027re like a mother too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u3000\u3048\u3078\u3078\u3002\n\u3060\u3068\u3057\u305F\u3089\u308F\u305F\u3057\u305F\u3061\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u4E0D\u601D\u8B70\u306A\u95A2\u4FC2\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think so? Hehe. I guess we have a rather unusual relationship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3063\u3001\u305D\u3046\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, we sure do!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u59C9\u59B9\u304C\u52A9\u3051\u5408\u3046\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306B\u3001\u79C1\u3082\n\u3000\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3092\u652F\u3048\u3089\u308C\u305F\u304B\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wonder if I was able to support Valeria, just like sisters should...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\uFF01\n\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3082\u79C1\u306E\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3067\u3044\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria! Please keep being my big sister!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u2026\u2026\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u306F\u3059\u3054\u304F\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3002\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u30C0\u30E1\u3002\n\u4ECA\u306E\u79C1\u306F\u59C9\u306B\u3075\u3055\u308F\u3057\u304F\u306A\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha... I\u0027m really happy you feel that way. But I still can\u0027t. I\u0027m not worthy of being a big sister yet!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u6C7A\u3081\u305F\uFF01\n\u79C1\u3001\u59C9\u306B\u306A\u308B\u305F\u3081\u4FEE\u884C\u306B\u51FA\u308B\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I\u0027ve decided! I\u0027m going on a journey to train to become a proper big sister!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6B21\u4F1A\u3046\u6642\u306B\u306F\u3001\n\u7ACB\u6D3E\u306A\u59C9\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u5E30\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308B\u304B\u3089\u3002\n\u305D\u306E\u6642\u307E\u3067\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When we meet again, I\u0027ll return as a proper big sister. Wait for me until then!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\uFF01\u3000\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u30FC\u3093\uFF01\n\u623B\u3063\u3066\u304D\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u30FC\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No! Big Sis Valeria! Please come back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]